OL,3,AUK needs plan in case of
OL,4,A'unprecedented' AI job losses, says
OL,5,Aminister
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe government must "take seriously the
OL,8,Fpossibility of an unprecedented impact
OL,9,Fon the jobs market" caused by
OL,10,Fartificial intelligence (AI), a UK
OL,11,Fminister has said.
OL,13,FAI Minister Kanishka Narayan said there
OL,14,Fwas no evidence so far of an overall
OL,15,Freduction in jobs as a result of AI,
OL,16,Fbut one of his priorities was to have a
OL,17,Fcontingency plan in place for worst
OL,18,Fcase scenarios.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,110,105,200,300,0,100
