OL,3,AUK needs plan in case of
OL,4,A'unprecedented' AI job losses, says
OL,5,Aminister
OL,6,
OL,7,F"If it's going to hit us in a big way,
OL,8,Fyou are going to want to be as ahead of
OL,9,Fthe curve as possible," he told a
OL,10,Ffringe meeting at the Labour Party
OL,11,Fconference.
OL,13,FCarsten Jung, of the IPPR think tank,
OL,14,Fsaid: "In a worst case scenario you
OL,15,Fcould have about 8 million jobs being
OL,16,Fnegatively affected by this."
